1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,038
This EMPTY shop is about to change someone's LIFE.

2
00:00:03,388 --> 00:00:04,121
Stay to the END

3
00:00:04,121 --> 00:00:05,415
to see what it BECOMES.

4
00:00:06,315 --> 00:00:07,417
This is ROSA.

5
00:00:07,417 --> 00:00:08,469
She works 9 to 5,

6
00:00:08,819 --> 00:00:09,913
and her hours make money

7
00:00:09,913 --> 00:00:10,889
for SOMEONE ELSE.

8
00:00:11,789 --> 00:00:13,218
OWNING a business flips that.

9
00:00:13,568 --> 00:00:14,894
Path one: a FRANCHISE.

10
00:00:14,894 --> 00:00:17,088
You buy a proven BRAND and its PLAYBOOK,

11
00:00:17,438 --> 00:00:18,386
but you pay a FEE,

12
00:00:18,386 --> 00:00:21,513
plus ROYALTIES, often 4 to 8% of sales.

13
00:00:21,863 --> 00:00:23,251
Path two: your OWN IDEA.

14
00:00:23,251 --> 00:00:24,087
CHEAPER to start,

15
00:00:24,087 --> 00:00:25,276
but it's ALL on you.

16
00:00:26,176 --> 00:00:28,154
Either way, the MATH is simple:

17
00:00:28,154 --> 00:00:30,251
SALES, minus COSTS, equals PROFIT.

18
00:00:30,601 --> 00:00:31,311
Train a TEAM,

19
00:00:31,311 --> 00:00:33,331
and the shop EARNS even when you're away.

20
00:00:34,231 --> 00:00:35,259
It's NOT easy.

21
00:00:35,259 --> 00:00:38,178
About HALF of new businesses close within 5 years.

22
00:00:38,528 --> 00:00:39,413
So start SMALL,

23
00:00:39,413 --> 00:00:40,284
TEST the idea,

24
00:00:40,284 --> 00:00:41,877
and READ every contract.

25
00:00:42,777 --> 00:00:44,612
So what did that empty shop BECOME?

26
00:00:45,562 --> 00:00:46,693
ROSA'S BAKERY.

27
00:00:47,043 --> 00:00:49,666
A year later, she hands her MANAGER the keys,

28
00:00:49,666 --> 00:00:51,203
and opens SHOP #2.

29
00:00:52,103 --> 00:00:53,730
Your first step is FREE:

30
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:56,177
write down 3 PROBLEMS people pay to fix.

